<section class="section" id="calculatorPage"><div class="container"><div class="section-title"><div><div class="label">LIVE CALCULATOR</div><h2>⚡ Kalkulator <span class="shine">Speed</span></h2><p>Pilih speed multiplier, treadmill, trail, dan durasi AFK sesuai pilihan di game. Nilai adalah referensi komunitas dan bisa berubah setelah update.</p></div><span class="badge">PERHITUNGAN OTOMATIS</span></div><div class="calculator"><div class="panel"><h3>Input Perhitungan</h3><div class="field"><label for="speed">Speed saat ini</label><input id="speed" value="10K" placeholder="Contoh: 10K, 2.5M, 1B"></div><div class="field"><label for="mult">Speed Multiplier (Shop)</label><select id="mult"><option value="1">Tanpa multiplier (x1)</option><option value="2" selected>x2</option><option value="4">x4</option><option value="8">x8</option><option value="16">x16</option><option value="32">x32</option><option value="64">x64</option><option value="128">x128</option><option value="256">x256</option><option value="512">x512</option><option value="1024">x1K</option><option value="2048">x2K</option><option value="4096">x4K</option></select></div><div class="field"><label for="tread">Treadmill (Speed per step)</label><select id="tread"><option value="2" selected>Basic (+2 / step)</option><option value="10">Upgraded (+10 / step)</option><option value="20">Advanced (+20 / step)</option><option value="40">Elite (+40 / step)</option><option value="80">Golden (+80 / step)</option><option value="500">Hacker (+500 / step)</option><option value="1000">Demonic (+1K / step)</option><option value="2000">Angelic (+2K / step)</option><option value="3000">Astral (+3K / step)</option><option value="4000">Guardian (+4K / step)</option></select></div><div class="field"><label for="trail">Trail (multiplier)</label><select id="trail"><option value="1">Tidak ada (x1)</option><option value="1.5">Grey Trail (x1.5)</option><option value="2">Green Trail (x2)</option><option value="2.5">Blue Trail (x2.5)</option><option value="3">Purple Trail (x3)</option><option value="3.5">Golden Trail (x3.5)</option><option value="4">Red Trail (x4)</option><option value="5">Galaxy Trail (x5)</option><option value="7">Secret Trail (x7)</option><option value="10">Eternal Trail (x10)</option><option value="14">Divine Trail (x14)</option><option value="20">Moonbloom Trail (x20)</option></select></div><div class="field"><label for="afk">Durasi AFK (jam)</label><input id="afk" type="number" min="0" max="1000" value="8"></div><button class="button primary" style="width:100%" id="calcBtn">HITUNG SEKARANG ⚡</button><p class="hint">Estimasi: gain per step treadmill × speed multiplier × trail. Diasumsikan 1 step per detik; hasil game nyata bisa berbeda, dan tier treadmill dapat berubah setelah update.</p></div><div class="panel"><h3>📊 Hasil Perhitungan</h3><div class="results"><div class="result"><small>Speed saat ini</small><strong id="rCurrent">10K</strong></div><div class="result"><small>Gain per step</small><strong id="rStep">0</strong></div><div class="result"><small>Gain per detik</small><strong id="rSec">0</strong></div><div class="result"><small>Gain per menit</small><strong id="rMin">0</strong></div><div class="result"><small>Gain per jam</small><strong id="rHour">0</strong></div><div class="result"><small>Durasi AFK</small><strong id="rTime">8 jam</strong></div><div class="result main"><small>✨ Estimasi speed setelah AFK</small><strong id="rTotal">10K</strong><p class="hint" id="rSummary">Atur input lalu tekan hitung.</p></div></div></div></div></div></section>
<section class="section" id="harga"><div class="container"><div class="section-title"><div><div class="label">PRICE LIST</div><h2>Daftar Harga <span class="shine">Joki</span></h2><p>Pilih paket, lalu lengkapi form order di bawah.</p></div></div><div class="prices"><article class="card"><div class="card-icon">🏃</div><h3>Joki AFK 1 Hari</h3><div class="price">Rp10.000 <small>/ hari</small></div><p>Paket joki AFK harian.</p><button class="button" onclick="selectPackage('Joki AFK 1 Hari')">Pilih Paket</button></article><article class="card featured"><div class="card-icon">🔥</div><h3>Joki AFK 7 Hari</h3><div class="price">Rp30.000</div><p>Paket mingguan lebih hemat.</p><button class="button primary" onclick="selectPackage('Joki AFK 7 Hari')">Pilih Paket</button></article><article class="card"><div class="card-icon">🥚</div><h3>Joki Egg 1 Hari</h3><div class="price">Rp20.000</div><p>Paket egg durasi satu hari.</p><button class="button" onclick="selectPackage('Joki Egg 1 Hari')">Pilih Paket</button></article><article class="card"><div class="card-icon">⏱️</div><h3>Joki Egg 12 Jam</h3><div class="price">Rp10.000</div><p>Paket egg durasi 12 jam.</p><button class="button" onclick="selectPackage('Joki Egg 12 Jam')">Pilih Paket</button></article></div></div></section>
<section class="section" id="order"><div class="container"><div class="section-title"><div><div class="label">ORDER FORM</div><h2>Form <span class="shine">Pemesanan</span></h2><p>Isi detail pesanan, lalu lanjut ke WhatsApp admin MAYASHI.</p></div></div><div class="order-grid"><div class="panel"><h3>Detail Pesanan</h3><div class="field"><label for="package">Paket pilihan</label><select id="package"><option>Joki AFK 1 Hari</option><option>Joki AFK 7 Hari</option><option>Joki Egg 1 Hari</option><option>Joki Egg 12 Jam</option></select></div><div class="field"><label for="username">Username game</label><input id="username" placeholder="Masukkan username game"></div><div class="field"><label for="wa">Nomor WhatsApp kamu (opsional)</label><input id="wa" placeholder="08xxxxxxxxxx"></div><div class="field"><label for="notes">Catatan tambahan</label><textarea id="notes" rows="3" placeholder="Target atau permintaan tambahan"></textarea></div><button class="button primary" style="width:100%" onclick="sendOrder()">Kirim Pesanan ke WhatsApp ↗</button><p class="hint">Jangan masukkan password atau kode OTP akun game.</p></div><div class="panel"><h3>Alur Pemesanan</h3><p class="muted">1. Pilih layanan dari daftar harga.</p><p class="muted">2. Isi username dan catatan yang diperlukan.</p><p class="muted">3. Tekan tombol untuk membuat pesan order.</p><p class="muted">4. Admin akan mengonfirmasi ketersediaan, harga, dan detail pembayaran.</p><div style="margin-top:18px;padding:14px;border-radius:11px;background:#0e0d1e;border:1px solid var(--line)"><strong>ℹ️ Informasi</strong><p class="hint">Pesanan akan membuka WhatsApp admin MAYASHI di 08972330684 dengan pesan yang sudah terisi. Tekan Kirim di WhatsApp untuk mengirim pesanan.</p></div></div></div></div></section>
<section class="section faq" id="faq"><div class="container"><div class="section-title"><div><div class="label">HELP CENTER</div><h2>Pertanyaan <span class="shine">Umum</span></h2></div></div><details><summary>Bagaimana menggunakan kalkulator speed?</summary><p>Masukkan speed saat ini, lalu pilih speed multiplier, treadmill, trail, dan durasi AFK.</p></details><details><summary>Apakah harga di website sudah final?</summary><p>Harga paket mengikuti daftar harga MAYASHI STORE yang ditampilkan pada halaman ini.</p></details><details><summary>Apakah order otomatis tersimpan?</summary><p>Belum. Website ini menyiapkan pesan WhatsApp dari browser dan tidak menyimpan order ke server.</p></details><details><summary>Apakah perlu memasukkan password game?</summary><p>Tidak. Jangan bagikan password akun game atau kode OTP kepada siapa pun.</p></details></div></section>
